Origin: EmberBSD, AI-assisted. Local patch; not submitted upstream.

Handle NetBSD wscons absolute pointers using raw HID calibration bounds.

No physical resolution is supplied by wscons: untransformed accessors use
the same one-unit fallback convention as libinput for missing resolution.

